' ============================================================
' 4G – Attach / TAU / Service Request Failure
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – Attach / TAU / Service Request Failure

participant UE
participant eNB as "eNodeB"
participant MME
participant HSS as "HSS/DB"

[1] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>RRC Connection Request</color>
[2] eNB -> MME: <color:orange>S1AP Initial UE Message (Attach/TAU)</color>
[3] MME -> HSS: <color:green>Update Location / Auth Info</color>
[4] HSS --> MME: <color:green>Auth vectors / subscriber data</color>
[5] MME -> UE: <color:green>Authentication Request (via eNB)</color>
[6] UE --> MME: <color:green>Authentication Response</color>

alt Success
  [7] MME -> SGW: <color:orange>Create Session Request</color>
  [8] SGW -> PGW: <color:orange>Create Default Bearer</color>
  [9] MME -> UE: <color:blue>Attach Accept (via eNB)</color>
else Failure
  [7] MME --> eNB: <color:red>S1AP Failure / Context Setup Failure</color>
  [8] eNB -> UE: <color:red>RRC Release / Attach Reject</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* MME cause codes: e.g., 19 – No suitable cells, 21 – TA not allowed
* Common causes: MME overload, S1AP IE mismatch, Tracking Area misconfig
end
@enduml


' ============================================================
' 4G – RRC Connection Failure / RLF
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – RRC Connection Failure / RLF / Re-establishment Loop

participant UE
participant eNB as "eNodeB"

[1] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>RRC Connection Setup Request</color>
[2] eNB -> UE: <color:blue>RRC Connection Setup</color>
[3] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>RRC Connection Setup Complete</color>

note over UE,eNB: Radio link fails (RLF)

[4] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>RRC Re-establishment Request</color>

alt Re-establishment success
  [5] eNB -> UE: <color:blue>RRC Re-establishment</color>
else Failure
  [5] eNB -> UE: <color:red>RRC Re-establishment Reject</color>
  [6] UE -> MME: <color:green>Triggers TAU / Attach retry</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* Cause codes: RRC setup failures often appear as cause 2 (Radio link failure)
* Common causes: interference, PRACH mismatch, wrong timers
end
@enduml


' ============================================================
' 4G – S1AP Errors (Setup / Context Setup / Path Switch)
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – S1AP Errors (S1 Setup / Context Setup / Path Switch)

participant eNB as "eNodeB"
participant MME
participant SGW

[1] eNB -> MME: <color:orange>S1 Setup Request</color>
alt S1 Setup Success
  [2] MME -> eNB: <color:orange>S1 Setup Response</color>
else Failure
  [2] MME --> eNB: <color:red>S1 Setup Failure</color>
end

== Context / Path Switch ==
[3] eNB -> MME: <color:orange>Initial Context Setup Request</color>
[4] MME -> SGW: <color:orange>Modify Bearer / Path Switch Request</color>

alt Success
  [5] SGW --> MME: <color:orange>Modify Bearer Response</color>
  [6] MME -> eNB: <color:orange>Initial Context Setup Response</color>
else Failure
  [5] SGW --> MME: <color:red>Error / timeout</color>
  [6] MME --> eNB: <color:red>Context Setup Failure</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* Cause codes: 34 – No resources, 85 – S1AP undefined IE
* Common causes: S1AP IE mismatch, overload, transport issues
end
@enduml


' ============================================================
' 4G – Handover Failure (X2 / S1)
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – Handover Failure (X2 / S1)

participant UE
participant src_eNB as "Source eNodeB"
participant tgt_eNB as "Target eNodeB"
participant MME

[1] src_eNB -> tgt_eNB: <color:orange>X2 Handover Request</color>
[2] tgt_eNB -> src_eNB: <color:orange>X2 Handover Request Ack</color>
[3] src_eNB -> UE: <color:blue>RRC Reconfiguration (HO Command)</color>
[4] UE -> tgt_eNB: <color:blue>RRC Reconfiguration Complete</color>
[5] tgt_eNB -> MME: <color:orange>Path Switch Request</color>

alt Success
  [6] MME -> SGW: <color:orange>Update Bearer</color>
  [7] SGW --> MME: <color:orange>Update Bearer Response</color>
  [8] MME -> tgt_eNB: <color:orange>Path Switch Ack</color>
else Failure
  [6] tgt_eNB -> src_eNB: <color:red>Handover Failure</color>
  [7] src_eNB -> UE: <color:red>RRC Re-establish or Release</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* Cause codes: 11 – Handover failure, 21 – Target cell not allowed
* Common causes: neighbor misconfig, measurement misalignment, timer issues
end
@enduml


' ============================================================
' 4G – EPS Bearer Establishment Failure
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – EPS Bearer Establishment Failure

participant UE
participant eNB as "eNodeB"
participant MME
participant SGW
participant PGW
participant PCRF

[1] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>PDN Connectivity Request</color>
[2] eNB -> MME: <color:green>Forward PDN Request</color>
[3] MME -> SGW: <color:orange>Create Session Request</color>
[4] SGW -> PGW: <color:orange>Create Session</color>
[5] PGW -> PCRF: <color:green>Policy Request</color>

alt Success
  [6] PGW --> SGW: <color:orange>Session Created</color>
  [7] SGW --> MME: <color:orange>Create Session Response</color>
  [8] MME -> eNB: <color:blue>Activate Default Bearer</color>
else Failure
  [6] PGW --> SGW: <color:red>Reject (DNN/APN/Policy)</color>
  [7] SGW --> MME: <color:red>Create Session Failure</color>
  [8] MME -> eNB: <color:red>Attach / PDN Reject</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* Cause codes: 27 – Insufficient resources, 39 – APN not supported
* Common causes: DNN mismatch, PCRF policy reject, QoS misconfig
end
@enduml


' ============================================================
' 4G – Paging Failure
' ============================================================
@startuml
title 4G – Paging Failure

participant MME
participant eNB as "eNodeB"
participant UE

[1] MME -> eNB: <color:orange>Paging Request</color>
[2] eNB -> UE: <color:blue>Paging Indication</color>

alt UE reachable
  [3] UE -> eNB: <color:blue>RRC Connection Request</color>
  [4] eNB -> MME: <color:orange>Paging Response</color>
else Fail
  note right
  <color:red>UE does not respond</color>
end

note bottom
Footnotes:
* Cause codes: 19 – No suitable cells, 21 – Tracking area mismatch
* Common causes: coverage gaps, DRX misalignment, paging overload
end
@enduml
